 "drug_rule": "Concomitant use of an MAOI and an SSRI is contraindicated due to the risk of serotonin syndrome - a potentially life-threatening condition caused by excessive central serotonin activity. The interaction is not merely a pharmacokinetic effect but a pharmacodynamic one that persists even after the parent drug is stopped, as metabolites can accumulate and inhibit serotonin reuptake.",
